INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Je''daii Order and Tython','history-jedaii-tython','Legends • Dawn of the Jedi. The Je''daii tradition predates the familiar Jedi Order and explores balance through the opposing influences associated with Tython''s moons Ashla and Bogan. Its relationship to later Jedi doctrine is a historical question within Legends, not a universal Canon origin story. Read Dawn of the Jedi: Force Storm and subsequent volumes. Study how environmental conditions and institutional practices shape a tradition''s understanding of balance.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Great Sith War and the Old Republic','history-great-sith-war','Legends • Tales of the Jedi. The Great Sith War centers on Exar Kun and Ulic Qel-Droma and precedes the era depicted in Knights of the Old Republic. It explores fallen Jedi, political fragmentation and the transmission of forbidden teachings. Read Dark Lords of the Sith and The Sith War in sequence. Keep this conflict distinct from the Great Hyperspace War and the later Jedi Civil War.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Mandalorian Wars and Jedi Civil War','history-mandalorian-jedi-civil','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic. The Mandalorian Wars divide the Jedi over intervention; Revan and Malak subsequently lead a conflict against the Republic. The games examine how wartime choices can reshape identity and institutions. Compare the first game''s account with the aftermath depicted in its sequel. Do not import the entire narrative into Canon merely because individual names recur.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The New Sith Wars and the Ruusan reforms','history-ruusan-reforms','Legends • Darth Bane trilogy and Jedi vs. Sith. The closing period of the New Sith Wars includes the Brotherhood of Darkness and the conflict on Ruusan. The subsequent reforms reshape the Republic and Jedi relationship in Legends. Bane''s Rule of Two represents a different model of Sith continuity. Compare political reform with religious restructuring rather than treating the two as identical.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Ulic Qel-Droma','character-ulic-qel-droma','Legends • Tales of the Jedi. Ulic''s attempt to confront the Sith leads to his own fall and involvement in the Great Sith War. His later story explores remorse, consequences and redemption. Read Dark Lords of the Sith, The Sith War and Redemption. Discussion: can accountability remain meaningful when restoration of former status is impossible?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Nomi Sunrider','character-nomi-sunrider','Legends • Tales of the Jedi. Nomi becomes a Jedi after personal loss and develops into an important figure in the Great Sith War era. Her story connects family, grief, leadership and responsibility. Compare her choices with Ulic''s trajectory. Her fictional abilities should be distinguished from practical approaches to grief and ethical judgment.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Darth Malak','character-darth-malak','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic. Malak is Revan''s former companion and apprentice who becomes a central antagonist during the Jedi Civil War. Their relationship illustrates rivalry and instability within a hierarchy founded on personal power. Study the game''s narrative and distinguish established plot events from player-dependent choices.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Meetra Surik','character-meetra-surik','Legends • Knights of the Old Republic II and Revan. The Jedi Exile is a player character whose later Legends identity is Meetra Surik. Her story examines exile, connections to others and the aftermath of war. Distinguish the game''s branching choices from later fixed biographical details. Consider how identity can persist after separation from an institution.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sacred locations: Ossus','location-ossus','Canon and Legends, separate accounts. Ossus is associated with Jedi learning and historical institutions. Legends gives the world a prominent role in Tales of the Jedi; Canon also connects it with Luke Skywalker''s Jedi school. Catalog these portrayals separately. Its symbolic significance is the preservation and rebuilding of knowledge.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sacred locations: Jedha','location-jedha','Canon • Rogue One and The High Republic publishing material. Jedha is a pilgrimage world associated with multiple Force traditions and kyber. Its religious diversity challenges the assumption that every Force believer belongs to the Jedi or Sith. Study the Guardians of the Whills and the wider religious setting without treating fictional pilgrimage customs as historical Earth practices.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Guardians of the Whills','force-guardians-whills','Canon • Rogue One and Guardians of the Whills. Chirrut Imwe and Baze Malbus illustrate different relationships to faith, service and the sacred traditions of Jedha. Their portrayal provides a starting point for studying religious identity outside Jedi and Sith membership. Distinguish devotion to the Force from demonstrated Jedi training.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='force-studies' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Baran Do and alternative Force traditions','force-baran-do','Legends • Fate of the Jedi: Outcast. The Baran Do are a Kel Dor Force tradition associated with contemplation and perception. Their portrayal offers a contrast to Jedi and Sith institutional models. Compare their educational priorities with other fictional traditions, without presenting fictional precognition as a demonstrated human skill.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='force-studies' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';